	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TI UCC21550BDWK, 14-pin DWK package (SLUSE89C, Aug 2024). Table 13.1 of the datasheet confirms DWK shares the same land pattern envelope/pitch as the 16-pin DW package (both use the DW0016B SOIC-16W 7.5x10.3mm 1.27mm-pitch outline; reel/tape dimensions in the same table are otherwise identical). DWK is fabricated on the same 16-lead frame with 2 leads omitted at physical positions 12 and 13 for isolation creepage/clearance -- confirmed against the Pin Configuration diagram (Section 4), which lists DWK pin numbers as 1-11 then 14-16, skipping 12/13 entirely (no NC pin at those numbers -- they simply don't exist on this package). This footprint is the real Package_SO:SOIC-16W_7.5x10.3mm_P1.27mm.kicad_mod land pattern with pads 12 and 13 deleted; all 14 remaining pad positions/sizes are untouched from that verified real footprint. The 3D model reference below is the 16-pin DW step file kept as a visual approximation (it will render 2 phantom leads at the omitted positions) -- no DWK-specific step model was available in the fetched datasheet.")
